{#
  Font preloading.

  Intentionally empty: the theme does not ship web-font files in this
  repository (no .woff2 assets, no @font-face in the CSS), so there is
  nothing to preload. The previous markup pointed at
  /{{ webtheme_path }}/fonts/*.woff2 which, with a leading-slash
  webtheme_path, rendered a protocol-relative "//…" URL and produced
  console "ERR_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED" / 404 errors.

  If self-hosted fonts are added to the theme, re-add the preload links
  here using {{ webtheme_path }} (no leading slash — webtheme_path already
  begins with one), e.g.:

    <link rel="preload" href="{{ webtheme_path }}/fonts/example.woff2"
          as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
#}
